---
title: State Machine — Attribution / Duplicate Dispute (SF-04)
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> OPEN : Affiliate raises dispute
  OPEN --> UNDER_REVIEW : Admin starts review
  OPEN --> WITHDRAWN : Affiliate withdraws
  UNDER_REVIEW --> UPHELD : Admin upholds (transfer attribution)
  UNDER_REVIEW --> REJECTED : Admin rejects claim
  UPHELD --> [*]
  REJECTED --> [*]
  WITHDRAWN --> [*]
